rgin of the specimen is  inked black   Micros  1 6  Serial sectioning from anterior superior to anterior inferior  margin  7 frags  6 cass  ESS   Micro  7  Second fragment  3 frags  1 cass  ESS   The second specimen  labelled   2  left axillary node contents   consists of a  single fragment of unoriented tan pink fibroadipose soft tissue  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x  2 5cm in overall dimension  that upon sectioning yields seven possible lymph  nodes  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 1 4cm in maximum dimension   Micros  8 9  Left axillary nodes  7 frags  2 cass  RSS   Reports to  EBERLEIN  TIMOTHY  JOSEPH M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  LUMPECTOMY  ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  AXILLARY NODES   report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
