Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  Amend Addenda  Type  Surgical Pathology  Specimen Type  Breast  excisional tissue  Procedure Date  REMOVED_DATE  Ordering Provider  JULIE L JONES M D   CASE  BS 08  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_PATIENT_NAME  DORGAN             Addended Report              Resident  Shakti Ramkissoon  M D   Ph D   Pathologist  William R Welch  M D   PATHOLOGIC DIAGNOSIS   A  SPECIMEN DESIGNATED  LEFT BREAST WIRE LOCALIZED EXCISION    Breast tissue with biopsy site changes  scarring  and  sclerosing adenosis   B  SPECIMEN DESIGNATED  LEFT BREAST  ADDITIONAL MEDIAL TISSUE    Breast tissue with apocrine metaplasia  sclerosing  adenosis  fibroadenoma  0 5cm    and scarring   CLINICAL DATA   History  31 year old woman with breast enhancement on left breast MRI and  discordant core biopsy demonstrating sclerosing adenosis   Operation  Left breast MRI guided wire localized excisional biopsy   Operative Findings  Not provided   Clinical Diagnosis  Abnormal left breast MRI   TISSUE SUBMITTED   A 1  left breast wire localized excision with short stitch superior  long  stitch lateral   to mammo   B 2  left breast additional medial tissue  short stitch superior  long in new  medial margin   to mammo   RADIOLOGY   Specimen  1   MRI loc  no mammo correlate  Clip not in specimen   C  Denison  M D   Specimen  2   Enhancing area MRI with prior core bx tissue marker  Tissue  marker present in specimen  C  Denison  M D   GROSS DESCRIPTION   The specimen is received fresh  in two parts  each  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s  name and unit number   Part A    1  Left breast wire localized excision  short stitch superior  long  stitch lateral   consists of a REMOVED_DATE  anterior to posterior  x REMOVED_DATE  medial to  lateral  x REMOVED_DATE  inferior to superior cm breast excision with two localization  wires in placed and a short suture marking the superior margin and a long  suture marking the lateral margin  An accompanying specimen r