_ID   Additional sections of the  mass are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   and the lymph node is submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID          B  Received fresh  labeled  gallbladder   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm gallbladder  with a smooth to shaggy serosa  Opening reveals a moderate amount of  green brown  tenacious bile  The mucosa is diffusely stained green with diffuse  yellow stippling  The wall thickness averages 0 2cm  Representative sections  are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID      Immunohistochemical and in situ hybridization tests performed at Massachusetts  General Hospital have been developed and their performance characteristics  determined by the Immunohistochemistry Laboratories in the Department of  Pathology at Massachusetts General Hospital  They have not been cleared or  approved by the U S Food and Drug Administration  FDA   the FDA has determined  that such clearance or approval is not necessary       PART A  PANCREAS RESECTION  MIDDLE  PART B  GALLBLADDER CHOLECYSTECTOMY       report_end  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
