mitted as follows  D  Medial margin  entirely  E  Lateral margin  entirely  F G  Posterior margin  representative  closest  H  Inferior  I  Anterior  J  Superior  K  Tumor  center  R  Additional inferior margin  Labeled  posterior margin right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm yellow tan  irregular  fibrofatty tissue fragment that is inked in black  serially sectioned and entirely submitted as L  Labeled  inferior margin right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm yellow tan  fibrofatty tissue that is marked by a stitch on one side  The stitched surface is inked black  the opposite surface is inked blue  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as M and N  Also received is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm yellow tan  unmarked soft tissue fragment that is inked in black  bisected  and entirely submitted as O  Labeled  final shaved margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm aggregate of yellow tan  fibrofatty tissue fragments that are inked in black and entirely submitted as P through Q  Resident  TAN A  INCE  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     Frozen section diagnoses  1 and 2 Lymph nodes  right axillary sentinel   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  O R  Resident  SOUHAD YOUNES  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Andrew Eric Rosenberg  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISION PART B  BREAST  RIGHT  POSTERIOR MARGIN   PART C  BREAST  RIGHT  INFERIOR MARGIN   PART D  BREAST  RIGHT  FINAL SHAVED MARGINS   PART E  LYMPH NODES  RIGHT AXILLARY SENTINEL  , Excisional_biopsy_(Lumpectomy).
